# IOX: Exchange information between I/O system and A register - 5-bit mask instruction
# YAML: mask "1111_1000_0000_0000", opcode "0164000" (octal)
# Bidirectional I/O transfer based on direction bit
#
# P-code implementation for I/O exchange:
:IOX disp is op5=0x1D & disp {
    # Simplified I/O operation - device address in displacement field
    local device_reg:2 = disp;
    A = *[io_space]:2 device_reg;
}